      "GroupDto": {
        "GroupName": "R",
        "Description": "NAND reading (inputs A, B, BIAS constantly on, threshold 0.125) of the shipped 'Logic Gate NOT-NAND' gate. Role in the 2-bit program counter: the C0 arm of the high bit's XOR, R = NAND(C0, X). The whole PC composes at the logic layer, not optically: every gate's truth table is extracted once in isolation, so each stage restores clean 0/1 levels by construction \u2014 there is deliberately no multi-stage passive optical cascade here.",
