    {
      "GroupDto": {
        "GroupName": "H1",
        "Description": "NAND reading (inputs A, B, BIAS constantly on, threshold 0.125) of the shipped 'Logic Gate NOT-NAND' gate. Role in the 2-bit program counter: the count arm of the bit-1 multiplexer, H1 = NAND(INC1, NL) \u2014 passes the incremented bit while LOAD rests at 0. The whole PC composes at the logic layer, not optically: every gate's truth table is extracted once in isolation, so each stage restores clean 0/1 levels by construction \u2014 there is deliberately no multi-stage passive optical cascade here.",
