        "GroupName": "CPNL",
        "Description": "1x2 MMI Splitter copy gate (input A, outputs Y1 and Y2, threshold 0.375) built from the Demo PDK's MMI splitter. Role in the 2-bit program counter: the inverted select NL = NOT(LOAD) fans out onto the count arms H0 and H1 of both bit multiplexers. The whole PC composes at the logic layer, not optically: every gate's truth table is extracted once in isolation, so each stage restores clean 0/1 levels by construction \u2014 there is deliberately no multi-stage passive optical cascade here.",
